\par
The built-in connection first tries a direct encrypted path. It can use a relay\par
when a direct path is unavailable. A relay cannot read the end-to-end encrypted\par
Vadgr content. It can observe connection information, including network\par
addresses, endpoint public keys, connection times and traffic volume. If you\par
select Tailscale, your Tailscale configuration and Tailscale's terms apply.\par
